# Portal Charm: each event shown twice in a row (a progress event takes the handler each time; an event of lower
# priority would leave the second showing to Kupipi's own script), and Prog 2 (the trigger wants exactly 1). A Windurst
# char of rank 3 with four Rolanberries. 292 twice (Prog 1 each time, a berry taken each time); the mission completed
# (a GM), Prog 2 (a GM): nil (her script); Prog 1: 293, completed; the charm removed and Prog 1 again (GMs): 293 again;
# the charm removed: a trade: 291, completed; the charm removed: 291 again.
# Kupipi+1 is the Kupipi a client sees (17768467, status normal); the first (17768466) is cutscene_only.
char zone=HeavensTower pos=2,0,30.9 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=2
rank 3
item Rolanberry x4
login
trade Kupipi+1 Rolanberry x1              # the mission not completed: 292
finish                                    # a berry taken; Prog 1
trade Kupipi+1 Rolanberry x1              # 292 again
finish                                    # a berry taken; Prog 1
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars current
mission Windurst WrittenInTheStars completed
charvar HQuest[portalCharm]Prog 2         # GM
trigger Kupipi+1                          # Prog 2, not 1: nil (her script)
finish-if-event
charvar HQuest[portalCharm]Prog 1         # GM
trigger Kupipi+1                          # 293
finish                                    # complete: the Portal Charm; Prog cleared
delkeyitem PortalCharm                    # GM
charvar HQuest[portalCharm]Prog 1         # GM
trigger Kupipi+1                          # 293 again
finish                                    # complete
delkeyitem PortalCharm                    # GM
trade Kupipi+1 Rolanberry x1              # the mission completed: 291
finish                                    # complete; the berry taken
delkeyitem PortalCharm                    # GM
trade Kupipi+1 Rolanberry x1              # 291 again
finish                                    # complete; the berry taken
